                        <td valign="top" class="m_mcnTextContent" style="padding:0px 18px 9px">

                            <p class="m_ila-title" style="text-align:center; font-family:'Inter', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Helvetica', 'Arial', 'sans-serif'; font-size:30px;color:#79ed00"><span style="color:#79ed00">
                              Al Kanz | Update Relatives Information


</span></p>


<p style="text-align:left;  font-family:'Inter', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Helvetica', 'Arial', 'sans-serif';  font-size:17px;padding:3% 0% 0;color:#ffffff"><span style="color:#ffffff"></span>
Attn: All Staff<br>
<br>
As you are aware, staff and their immediate relatives are now eligible to participate in Al Kanz “Staff” prize draw but not any ila Bank prize draws such as Al Kanz draws for customers, or any other raffles with prizes.
<br>
<br>
To be eligible for the Al Kanz “Staff” prize draws, then this is a kind reminder to review and update the list of your "immediate relatives”. If you have already submitted this information, please take a moment to review the information provided previously to ensure it is still valid (if the information is outdated, we would appreciate if you could kindly update it).
<br>
<br>
If you have no relatives to report, kindly select this option on the form. Please use this <a href="https://ilabank--uatx.sandbox.my.salesforce-sites.com/PLA/RelativesForm">link</a> to complete or update the information.
<br>
<br>

Kindly note that “immediate relatives” are classified as Mother, Father, Spouse, Daughter, Son, Granddaughter and Grandson.
<br>
<br>
It is worth noting that you will be required to provide:
</p>

<ul class="list" style=" font-family:'Inter', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Helvetica', 'Arial', 'sans-serif';  color:#ffffff;font-size:17px;"> 
    <li>The mobile number your relatives used when opening ila Bank Accounts</li>
    <li>The CPR number of the relative</li>
    <li>The nature of your relationship</li>
    <li>Whether you would like this relative to be included or excluded from Al Kanz “Staff” prize draws</li>
	  </ul>	
      
<p style="text-align:left; font-family:'Inter', 'Helvetica Neue', 'Helvetica', 'Arial', 'sans-serif';  font-size:17px;padding:3% 0% 0;color:#ffffff">

  If any of the “immediate relatives“ you declared hold an ila Bank account, we will notify them that they are no longer eligible for prize draws as a result of your declaration.
    
<br>
<br>
Immediate relatives below the age of 18 do not need to be added to the list. However, you are kindly requested to update the list when they turn 18.
<br>
<br>
Please note that the information you provide will be managed strictly in accordance with the <a href="https://www.ilabank.com/PrivacyPolicy">Privacy Policy</a>

<br /><br />
If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact ammar.abdulrahman@ilabank.com in ila business team.
<br /><br />
Best regards,
<br />
ila Bank Team
<br /><br />



</p>

<br />

